cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "polymer-colloid-pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Python pipeline to set up, run (locally or on a PBS cluster) and analyse
  LAMMPS molecular-dynamics simulations of star polymers and bottlebrushes
  interacting with colloids.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Corsi
    given-names: Pietro
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/corsipietro/polymer-colloid-pipeline"
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - LAMMPS
  - star polymers
  - bottlebrush polymers
  - colloids
  - soft matter
